  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till den kenyanska valprocessen f&#xf6;r president, parlament och lokalval i december 2007. St&#xf6;det inkluderar kapacitetsutveckling till den kenyanska valkommissionen f&#xf6;r att genomf&#xf6;ra sitt mandat. Dessutom ing&#xe5;r st&#xf6;d till v&#xe4;ljarutbildning och nationell valobservation genom civila samh&#xe4;llet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">support to the Kenyan electoral process and the presidential, parliamentary and civic election in December 2007. The main counter part is the Electoral Commission of Kenya but other stakeholders as the Office of the registrar and the Police is targeted. For voter education and domestice observation the media and civil society will be involved.</narrative>
  </description>
